1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,267
Hi Claudians!

2
00:00:01,467 --> 00:00:02,595
Hit your weekly limit?

3
00:00:02,795 --> 00:00:03,821
Here are two tips.

4
00:00:04,183 --> 00:00:05,890
One: open Settings, Usage.

5
00:00:06,090 --> 00:00:07,555
You may have a free limit reset.

6
00:00:07,755 --> 00:00:09,375
One click, and your week is back.

7
00:00:10,083 --> 00:00:13,132
Two: on Max or Ultra, keep
building with the API.

8
00:00:13,332 --> 00:00:16,062
Monthly API credits, up to $200.

9
00:00:16,783 --> 00:00:17,672
They don't roll over.

10
00:00:17,872 --> 00:00:18,515
Use them!
